window.products.push({"id":939094,"name":"Hand Poured Chunk Scented Candle - Exotic Island - 80 Hour Burn Time - All Natural & Organic - Award Winning Scent Hand Crafted Soy Wax Candle Mason J","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kmlZZs2eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LONG LASTING SCENT: After experimenting with scented natural wax chunks, we've managed to create the perfect blend of aromas - Precious Fruits. Each and every candle is a unique piece of art hand-crafted in the US and designed to give you the ultimate aromatherapy treat. THE PERFECT GIFT: Sometimes finding the perfect gift for friends, family, loved one, birthdays, holidays or any other occasion can be a bit overwhelming. So we mixed our passion for handcrafts, essential oils and flavors in a 16 oz of luscious, highly scented wax candle, hand poured with the utmost care, all packed in a chic mason jar that you can use afterwards. NON TOXIC EVEN BURN : We are an eco friendly company, so our products are all natural, biodegradable and recyclable. We use non toxin lead-free cotton wicks so that you can enjoy a clean and even burn and a persistent scent. OUR SECRET? CHUNKS!: We take extra steps to make our special candles -in terms of color, scent and type of wax we use. We handcraft our scented chunks, cut them in different shapes and sizes and then fit them in a jar using a combination blend of soy wax. Our chunks slow down the burn time which makes them even better than solid, single pour candles. SIZE& BURN TIME: 16 oz, guaranteed even 80 hour burn with the proper care( keeping your wicks trimmed to one fourth of an inch)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kmlZZs2eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GEAR DISTRICT","source_asin":"B084P68LK5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084P68LK5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084P68LK5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
