window.products.push({"id":939110,"name":"Mug 12 oz Porcelain Novelty Coffee Iced Tea Cappuccino Cup Birthday Anniversary Holiday Party Gifts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DjOCo7lRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why we choose Porcelain ? Plastic and metal cups often leave their ingredients in the beverage to change the taste and properties, making you feel unsatisfied with the drinking experience. What’s Better Than A Morning Cup Of Coffee? Coffee is a rather common drink, particularly for everyone to take on their morning. Why not enjoy your coffee with coffee mugs? This coffee mugs set suits for you to enjoy coffee, tea, or any drinks you want with your family, friends or colleagues. JUST LIKE IN THE RESTAURANT The mugs are beautiful, colorful -- they brought me joy.” “There's something so cozy about making a cup of tea or coffee in this mug.” Said from our customers. So simple but elegant design, the mugs are smart size with 12 oz, right weight, sturdy. Well balanced and comfortable in your hand, just like in the restaurant! These are perfect for holding and warming two hands, or snuggling up with a giant cup and a good book. PRO-GRADE PORCELAIN These mugs are made of durable porcelain, a type of premium LEAD-FREE and NON-TOXIC ceramic, chip-resistant and more sturdy than stoneware. Easy clean up that they go into the dishwasher. Creation of ensures you get what you pay for! CLEANUP EASILY & NO STAIN These porcelain mugs are clean up well in the dishwasher or by hand and no residue left, no need to worry about stains. The luster still looks like new after long time use. SWEET GIFT Easy gift and thoughtful and unique. These mugs would be the best gift to send to your parents, sisters, brothers, lover, friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DjOCo7lRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"lyx","source_asin":"B087R2VKSZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939110","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087R2VKSZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087R2VKSZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
