window.products.push({"id":939129,"name":"Rymmzone Magnetic Knife Holder for Refrigerator, 17\" Double-Sided Knife Magnetic Strip, Premium SUS304 Stainless Steel Magnetic Knife Holder for Wall,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GNHmbO-cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Refrigerator Applicable】Rymmzone magnetic knife holder for refrigerator has heavy duty magnets on both sides. It can be easily installed on the side of your refrigerator without the use of screws and adhesives and takes only 1 minute to complete! 【Thoughtful Accessories】Our magnet knife holder come with 2 EVA non-slip pads (each size: 1.38\" x 2\"), they protect the refrigerator from scratches when moving the knife holder. You can freely adjust the position of the knife rack. 【Never Rusts】This magnetic knife holder is made of SUS304 stainless steel. The main difference is corrosion resistance - Type 304 is more corrosion resistant than Type 201, which means it has lifetime durability under normal environmental conditions (making it more expensive as well). The ends of this magnetic knife strip are completely sealed. It is moisture, water and rust resistant. 【Larger Storage Size】Our 17\" knife holder can hold more knives at the same time than other 16\" knife holders - from large and heavy to small and light, such as 9\" 0.4 lb chef's knife, 7\" 1.2 lb cleaver, 9\" 0.4 lb santoku knife, 10\" 0.4 lb bread knife, 6\" 0.5 lb fillet knife, 2\" 0.03 lb paring knife, 5\" 0.1 lb carving knife, etc. (The knives have a magnetic strip Actual length of 17 inches, width of 1.6 inches and thickness of 0.6 inches.) 【Simple & Elegant Modern Design】Magnet knife holder strip is designed with a sleek, elegant look. The flat, space-saving magnetic knife holder for wall has a modern design that fits any kitchen style. Our kitchen knife holder design and straightforward installation make storage of your knives and stainless steel utensils a part of your kitchen decor!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GNHmbO-cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rymmzone","source_asin":"B0BCPZL467","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCPZL467","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCPZL467","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
