window.products.push({"id":939266,"name":"GET FRESH Forks for Kids – 30 - Picks for Kids Fruit Forks Bento Box Picks Reusable Mini Toothpick Sticks Heart Dessert Forks for Children Party Bento","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71plc7SosEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✮ SAFE FOR KIDS ✮ - Our dessert kids forks are BPA free and very easy to use. They do not affect aroma, food consistency or flavour. At the same time little kids should be accompanied by a parent to use these cute food picks for kids. ✮ REUSABLE AND EASY TO CLEAN ✮ - these festive bento deco food picks for children are very easy to use and clean. After each usage just put these toothpicks into the cup with water and shake for quick cleaning. Notice: hand wash only. ✮ 5 COLORS AND CUTE DESIGNS ✮ - our star and heart shaped fruit picks set for children and toddlers includes 5 colours - 6 pcs each colour! These cute designed and colourful heart and star food picks set has very cute 2d design and rich colours that will not leave you and your kid uninvolved. These reusable animal food picks for kids gives ability to create any type of lunch variation that your little Picky Eater likes! ✮ FIT FRUITS & VEGETABLES ✮ - these cute bento deco vegetable forks for kids can be used for all types of food, such as fruits and vegetables as well as desserts and snacks. For sure - they will make your kid’s meal brighter and more enjoyable as usual everyday mealtime. Please, check the size of our kids food picks before purchase. ✮ BEST GIFT FOR BOYS & GIRLS ✮ - our fruit forks are specially designed for kids of different age. These ones are a perfect solution for your little Picky Eaters! Our children food picks for toddlers will help you to ease the feeding process of your kids with healthy foods!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71plc7SosEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GET FRESH","source_asin":"B09WMZZ9R6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WMZZ9R6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WMZZ9R6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":939267,"name":"Melrose Home Jacobean 150 GSM Heavy Cotton Flannel Sheet Set, Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yiKFDLxXS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When cool weather settles in, few things feel better than the warmth and coziness of flannel sheets. Made of 100 percent cotton with a flannel weight of 150 grams per square meter, this affordable collection from Melrose Home has been brushed and combed to provide higher loft and extra comfort. Its all-natural fibers feel nice against the skin and only get softer with use. Purchase of a Full-, Queen-, or King-sized set includes a flat sheet, fitted sheet, and two pillow cases. The Twin set differs only in the inclusion of a single pillowcase rather than two. Out of the package, the bedding is slightly oversized. This generous cut ensures a perfect fit after each piece has been washed once or twice. Care and maintenance couldn't be easier as the material safely cleans in the washing machine and can be tossed in the dryer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yiKFDLxXS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melrose Home","source_asin":"B000H0VTVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000H0VTVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000H0VTVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":939268,"name":"Bellemain Thermal Slow Cooker Carrying Bag (M) For the Hamilton Beach Set 'n Forget Slow Cooker, 6-Quart Model 33969A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rf5Prx9SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When you're bringing your homemade specialties to a family, work or church get-together, Bellemain lets you be sure that they'll arrive safely and ready to enjoy ... right out of the bag. Insulated Material Keeps Food at the Right Temperature Hot foods stay hot and cold foods stay cold inside this thermal insulated bag -- a great convenience if the event venue is short on oven or refrigerator space. Heavy-Duty Carrying Handles for Extra Security Two outer straps are made of super-strong nylon webbing to take the weight of a fully loaded cooker without tearing or ripping away from the bag. And the bag itself is tough, heavy-gauge nylon that won't split or come apart at the seams. Cooker Lid Tie-Down for No-Spill Travel Inside the bag is another strap that keeps the cooker lid from coming off during transport, and adds even more stability to the bag. 270° Zipper Allows Easy Access It's easy to load and unload the cooker from the carrying bag -- just unzip the sturdy zipper all the way around and flip open the top. It also makes cleaning easier. (The bag can be washed by hand when needed.) 1 Year Warranty Heavy-duty construction and materials are guaranteed to perform to your satisfaction, so you can share your culinary masterpieces with pride and confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rf5Prx9SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bellemain","source_asin":"B00KFQY1ZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939268","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KFQY1ZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KFQY1ZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":939269,"name":"Taco Holders Stainless Steel - Taco Rack Set of 4 - Taco Stand Dishwasher & Oven Safe - Taco Serving Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817EoYsCoRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Perfect Way to Impress Your Guests When Serving Those Delicious Tacos! Tired of making tacos with care then having everything fall out all over the place? Our no mess metal taco holders serve tacos, fajitas, flatbread wraps and hot dogs! Reheat tacos and tortillas or leftovers from the day before! Layer one taco after the other and the kids now have a place to set them down after they take a bite! Unlike baskets or plates, the taco shell holder lets you keep shells upright as you fill them without breaking or losing fillings. With their quality food grade 304 stainless steel and fun Mexican patterns that lets food breathe, this is a must-have taco stands shell holder set for every home. Assemble your tacos like the pros! Home meals will look like trendy restaurant taco bar serving dishes with these taco trays! You’ll love bringing homemade tacos out on these mexican serving dishes and they’re sure to get plenty of compliments! Grill and oven safe with no sharp edges, the taco rack holders are perfect for entertaining and great for taco nights in! These awesome taco stand up holders easily hold hard or soft taco shells, making them easy to fill and easy to eat! Big enough for 3 good sized tacos, while leaving more than enough room on the plate for side dishes. And they go right into the dishwasher for easy clean up, too! Strong and durable, easy to clean and easy to store, simply turn the mini taco holder one way for 2 tacos and the other way for 3 tacos! Heat the taco stands in the oven to keep your tacos warm a little longer, and the side handles come in handy when transporting from oven to table. Now you can quickly serve multiple tortillas and fill them in sequence instead of making one taco at a time! Plus no more aluminum foil for the landfill so you’re saving the planet, too! Don’t love your taco plates with dividers? Not a problem! Just get in touch with us and we’ll give you a refund!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817EoYsCoRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Niagara Blue","source_asin":"B07GF8PZ45","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GF8PZ45","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GF8PZ45","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
