window.products.push({"id":939293,"name":"Patoly Large Humidifiers for Large Room 2000 sq.ft, 4.2Gal/16L Top Fill Industrial Ultrasonic Humidifier Commercial Quiet Mist Humidifier with UV Lamp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51avPgh3Y2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Whole house & commercial & industrial humidifiers】 The humidifier is designed with 4 atomizing heads, and the mist output reaches 2000ML/H, which can humidify 2000sq.ft. 4.2Gal/16L large capacity water tank, humidifier can work continuously for 10 hours, suitable for whole house humidification, shopping malls, supermarkets, warehouses, offices, factories and vegetable greenhouses. 【Multi-Mist humidifier】 Provides a fogging method that can be heightened and oriented, which is convenient for humidifying the space in a targeted manner. At the same time, there is also a 360-degree fogging method that can be rotated freely. The fog volume is fine, which is suitable for humidifying the skin of the human body, and also helps the production and absorption of plants. 【Convenient Water Filling and Mobile Design Humidifier】You can easily and conveniently add water from the top without opening the lid (it can also be directly filled with tap water). The minimum water level is the height at which the water volume exceeds the water pump in the water tank, which is more conducive to prolonging the service life of the water pump and the water pumping of the water tank. There are four wheels at the bottom of the humidifier for easy and convenient free movement 【Smart Settings and Convenient Cleaning Humidifier】The humidifier has a large screen display, the numbers are clearly visible, dual control methods of remote control and manual touch are available, and it has a constant humidity function. When the humidifier reaches the set humidity, it will automatically stop humidifying. The humidifier also has a sleep function, allowing you to sleep peacefully. The humidifier will automatically shut down when there is a shortage of water. 【After-sales Service Policy】The best after-sales service team is always with you, please feel free to contact us about this humidifier for any refund, return or technical assistance. Note: The water pump and mist outlet fittings are in the water tank, please check and remove the protective bag of the water pump before use, and read the instructions carefully before use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51avPgh3Y2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Patoly","source_asin":"B093PPSMWG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093PPSMWG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093PPSMWG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
