window.products.push({"id":939442,"name":"HFDSA 3 Pieces Canvas Painting Winter Forest Daybreak Poster Wall Art Suitable for Living Room, Bedroom, Study, Children's Room,Creative Gift，Ready to","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UXqNIBBQS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Size:40x60cm x3 HD Prints  HD prints are created typically using professional 8-Color to 12-Color ink-jet printers.   Canvas Material  Our portrait painting on canvas has a very smooth texture and close weave. Perfect for paintings require a lot of details. Premium Cotton Canvases.  Artwork Framed  This art work comes already framed ready to hang, each panel has a wide hook already attached for easy hanging.  Customized Printing  Our canvas prints can also be custom-made to suit your own size, photos or pictures. Welcome to contact us via mail.  Perfect Gift Idea:  This wall art piece is more than general canvas printing poster, it is a unique piece of original artwork with stunning painted texture. A perfect gift for yourself and for loved ones.  As we continue to develop new paintings and original art collections, if you are looking for abstract paintings, landscape paintings, house paintings, hotel paintings, folk art or high-definition photo shoots on canvas, please contact us.  note:  1. When hanging three paintings, the best distance between the two paintings is 3cm, and the visual effect is more harmonious.  2. We will try our best to provide accurate descriptions and realistic pictures. Due to different computer screen settings, the actual color may be different from the color on the monitor.  3. Before buying, please measure the wall length.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UXqNIBBQS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HFDSA","source_asin":"B093QH48NB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093QH48NB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093QH48NB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":939443,"name":"Willow Tree Dance of Life Angel, Sculpted Hand-Painted Figure","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519W3x8BsML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"TITLE: Dance of Life SENTIMENT: Dancing…Twirling! The magical miracle of life GIFT-GIVING SUGGESTIONS: Song of Joy and Dance of Life angels are designed for the Willow Tree Nativity display. Or they can be enjoyed as table or mantel holiday decor. Singly or together, they are wonderful wedding gifts, new baby gifts, spiritual milestone commemoratives, and holiday pieces. Willow Tree angels resonate with many cultures and ages of people. To some they represent protection, to some they are an outward reminder of inner peace, and to some they represent a way to remember those who have left this earth. Hand-carved figures reveal their expression through body gestures only... a tilt of the head, placement of the hands, a turn of the body. Since 1999, American artist Susan Lordi has worked in partnership with DEMDACO to produce, market and distribute Willow Tree , her line of carved figurative sculpture. From her studio in Kansas City, Lordi hand carves the original of each figure. This piece is cast from Lordi's original and painted by hand. Enclosed inside each fitted packaging box is a gift-giving card with piece title and sentiment on it. Each piece is intended to be open to interpretation from the viewer. \"Willow Tree isn't so much about the tangible piece. It represents an emotion or it marks a memory.\" -Susan Lordi Ready to display on a shelf, table or mantel. To clean, dust with soft brush or cloth. Avoid water or cleaning solvents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519W3x8BsML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Willow Tree","source_asin":"B0063VCMNS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939443","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0063VCMNS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0063VCMNS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
