window.products.push({"id":939452,"name":"MOWO 36 inch Jumbo Confetti Balloons Giant Clear Latex Helium Balloons Large Pink and Gold Fuchsia Tissue Paper Confetti Balloons Wedding Decoration N","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Ajh-kDL3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Fun for a New Years Eve party, kids birthday party, gender neutral baby shower, Father's Day or summer party. It's a nice choice of decorations and will add happy atmosphere to any event you may have. The perfect combination of balloons and gauze is very romantic and beautiful. Attention Please: 1. This balloon could be blow up to 36”, so you need a tool to do you a favor. 2. You could inflate those balloons with air. But if you want them float in the air, you need to inflate them with helium.The floating time depend on the helium quality and purity, please use high purity helium to inflate 3. Rub the balloon on a carpet or other static surface to make those confetti stick to the sides. If not, the confetti would stay at the bottom of the balloon. 4. Helium balloon is sensitive to temperature change, DONOT expose to the sun with no shelter for a long time. 5. Adults supervision required, keep confetti and uninflated balloons away from children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Ajh-kDL3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOWO","source_asin":"B077JYW9ZT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077JYW9ZT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077JYW9ZT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":939453,"name":"Department 56 Halloween Village Boneyard Straight Fence Accessory, 1.85 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qWqUgTj9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One Christmas Evening, a group of friends set off to enjoy a dinner of celebration at a small country Inn nestled in a quiet River town. As they rounded a bend in the road, they saw the small, old-fashioned village decorated for the holidays. The lights, like fairies, glowed and sparkled amid the freshly fallen snow. All Evening, the conversation was full of Christmas memories and the visions the tiny town had evoked. Amidst the jovial banter and magical memories, the idea for a lighted Christmas village was born. That spark of an idea became a reality when, in 1976, Department 56 introduced a series of six hand-painted, ceramic buildings. The rest is history. Department 56 knows the importance of celebrating the holidays with family and friends. Savor your time together and make it extra special with Department 56.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qWqUgTj9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B01A9A4AV0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01A9A4AV0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01A9A4AV0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
