window.products.push({"id":939472,"name":"CafePress Narwhal Tote Bag Natural Canvas Tote Bag, Reusable Shopping Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+kvpt8NQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Your New Favorite Bag: Make a statement with a fun and functional canvas tote bag that shows off your unique personality. This versatile, multipurpose classic is sure to become your go-to reusable, foldable bag that is perfect for shopping, work, or vacation. Two Sizes: Small tote measures 15\" x 15 x 6\" with 26.5\" handles. Medium tote measures 15\" x 18\" x 6\" with 22\" handles. Each tote size features reinforced handles and full side and bottom support gussets for strength and durability. Professionally Printed: Our tote bags are imported from our trusted partners. Then each tote is expertly printed with sharp and vivid graphics using premium inks by our USA printing partner. Our quality totes are built to last: construction, design and graphic design placement. Easy To Care For Eco-Friendly Carryall Option: No need to use more plastic grocery bags, wasteful wrapping paper or other one time use products. Use for everyday errands, to present gifts, stow away items and organize with our minimalist tote bags. Once our cotton canvas bags become soiled, simply spot clean or place in washing machine on your favorite cold setting. Machine dry on low heat or hang dry. Ideal Everyday Tote or Gift : Treat yourself or surprise family members, friends, colleagues or your favorite teacher. Our beautifully designed cotton canvas tote bags make a unique and thoughtful present for Christmas, Easter, Mother's Day, birthdays, back-to-school, weddings, anniversary and so much more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+kvpt8NQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CafePress","source_asin":"B0BHZ9JKKP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939472","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHZ9JKKP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHZ9JKKP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":939473,"name":"Professional 4 in 1 Knife Sharpener, Sharpener For Knives Scissor, Chef Knife Sharpener to Restore Non-Serrated Knife Blades, Easy to Use for Kitchen,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HZVbvDZnL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Quickly sharpen the knife in 5 seconds For renewal of a blunt knife, you only need to place the sharpener on the desktop, hold the non-slip handle firmly in one hand, hold the knife in the other hand, and put the tail of the knife into the sharpening edge to keep the blade perpendicular to the desktop and not shake left and right. Press down and pull back with the strength of the sharpening, without pushing and pulling back and forth. 3-speed sharpener for different knife types Kitchen Knife~Fruit Knife~Chef's Knife~Scissors (easy to do) Please choose the sharpening position correctly: 1. Knife sharpener CRUDE position~Material: Tungsten steel alloy (exquisite and does not damage the knife, suitable for daily sharpening, adopts a grinding wheel structure, and the blade can be sharpened by pulling it back and forth)  2. Sharpener FINE position~Material: 600# diamond (diamond grinding head has high-strength grinding force, suitable for dull or just-opened knives, repeated lightly pulling)  3. Knife sharpener ESSENCE bit~Material: Ceramic (made of aviation ceramic materials. It is suitable for the maintenance of daily props, eliminates the iron filings and burrs generated during diamond friction, and polishes smoothly. Put the knife into the ceramic wheel to grind and keep Pull the blade back and forth with appropriate and even force at the center of the angle of the knife to make the blade sharp)  4. Grinding and cutting mouth: Open the scissors and put in the grinding and cutting mouth to clamp the blade of the scissors and push the magic wand evenly. Clamp and pull back like normal cutting objects and repeat the pull back operation several times.  5. Hold the non-slip handle firmly with the other hand during operation. Keep children away when sharpening the knife. After sharpening the knife, the blade is sharp, take it slowly and gently. The 4-stage multi-function sharpener facilitates your life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HZVbvDZnL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YF","source_asin":"B08CVFKSW5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CVFKSW5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CVFKSW5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
