window.products.push({"id":939664,"name":"Martex Clean Essentials Antimicrobial Cotton Pillowcase Pair, White, Standard (Model: 028828632289)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Tw2wTAokL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With SILVERbac Antimicrobial Technology, Martex Clean Essentials Solid Sheet Sets keep your bed fresher longer. They’re fabricated with silver-infused fibers that inhibit the growth of odor causing bacteria and do not wash out. These flat sheets, fitted sheets, and pillowcases feature a super-soft feel for a comfortable night’s sleep. Martex delivers every aspect of today's happy home, through moments of love, wellness, and inspiration. Available in neutral shades like White and Sand, plus cool hues like light Blue and Gray, Martex Clean Essentials solid sheets and pillowcases complement any décor. Available in Twin, Twin XL, Full, Queen, and King sizes. Machine wash warm with similar colors. Only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry medium, remove promptly. Warm iron as needed. * Made of 67% Cotton / 33% Polyester * Features SILVERbac Antimicrobial Technology powered by silver-infused fibers that inhibit the growth of odor-causing bacteria and do not wash out. Lab tested * Available in neutral and cool hues * Twin: Flat sheet measures 66”W x 96”L; fitted sheet measures 39”W x 75”L; standard pillowcase (1) measures 20”W x 30”L * Twin XL: Flat sheet measures 66”W x 101”L; fitted sheet measures 39”W x 80”L; standard pillowcase (1) measures 20”W x 30”L * Full: Flat sheet measures 81”W x 96”L; fitted sheet measures 54”W x 75”L; standard pillowcases (2) measure 20”W x 30”L * Queen: Flat sheet measures 90”W x 102”L; fitted sheet measures 60”W x 80”L; standard pillowcases (2) measure 20”W x 30”L * King: Flat sheet measures 108”W x 102”L; fitted sheet measures 78”W x 80”L; king pillowcases (2) measure 20”W x 40”L * Standard pillowcase pair: measures 20”W x 30”L * King pillowcase pair: measures 20”W x 40”L * Fitted sheets fit mattresses up to 15” deep and feature all-around elastic for a snug fit * Machine washable and dry safe","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Tw2wTAokL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Martex","source_asin":"B092RMQK1X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939664","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092RMQK1X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092RMQK1X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":939665,"name":"Right Angle Drill, 1/2 In, 355/750 RPM","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":309.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41y2JFgZjYL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Right Angle Drill, Chuck Size (In.) 1/2, - No Load RPM with R/A Low, - No Load RPM with R/A High, Drill Speed (RPM) 0-355/0-750, Amps @ 120V 7.0 A, Reversing Yes, Quadruple Gear Reduction, Bearings Ball and Roller, Spindle Size (In.) 1/2-20, Tool Length (In.) 16-1/4, Tool Weight (Lb.) 10.3, Cord Type 3 Conductor, Quik-Lok, 8 ft., Features Side Handle, Carrying Case, Head and Handle Swivel 360 Degrees , Trigger Switch, D Handle Type Amazon.com As everyone knows, both plumbing and electrical work require drilling in tight spots. While the Milwaukee Hole Hawg may be the choice for most professional plumbers and electricians, this less-expensive right-angle drill is a solid option to consider for the same applications. Featuring a slim, lightweight design and great versatility, Milwaukee's right-angle drill has a 1/2-inch chuck and three speed ranges and is fully adjustable. The head and handle swivel 360 degrees and can be locked tight in any position, allowing you to fit this drill anywhere this drill could possibly fit. HVAC contractors can use this drill with bits to 4-5/8 inches without a problem. And, if necessary, the right-angle mechanism can be removed and the drill converted to straight D-handle use. If you have major remodel or construction plans, this is a smart drill to consider. --Tim Block From the Manufacturer Used extensively for drilling between joist and studs, in tight corners, or in close quarters, this 7 amp heavy-duty drill has all ball and roller bearings for durability and long-term use. The head and handle swivel 360 degrees and can be locked tight in any position for difficult drilling angles. This variable-speed drill can handle up to 4-5/8-inch selfeed bits, and delivers 0 to 355 rpm on low, 0 to 750 rpm on high, and 0 to 500 rpm with the right angle driver removed. Your kit includes tool with Quik-Lok cord, RAD drive, 9/16-inch open-end wrench, socket wrench, chuck remover bar, side handle, and impact-resistant plastic carrying case. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41y2JFgZjYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Milwaukee","source_asin":"B009HEG5Q8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939665","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009HEG5Q8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009HEG5Q8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":939666,"name":"Anti Barking Device, 2019 New Designed Outdoor Dog Repellent Device Bark Box with Adjustable Ultrasonic Level Control Safe for Small Medium Large Dogs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QgzkQeKeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ Description ] 1. This bark control device was built to offer pet owners more professional ways to train their pets. 2. It is powered by a 9-volt battery replaceable battery which you insert into the unit. With the aid of an internal microphone which picks up dog bark, Outdoor Bark Control is automatically activated when it detects barks up to 50 feet away. It then emits ultrasonic sound. 3. On hearing this high-pitched sound, the dog immediately stops barking as it will associate its bark with this unpleasant noise. When the dog stops barking the ultrasonic sound also stops. 4. The new outdoor bark control has 4 range levels including a test mode. It has 2 LED to indicate good or bad battery. 5. The New Outdoor Bark Control comes in a beautiful, well-designed birdhouse unit. [ Features ] 1. Defer noisy barking by harmless ultrasonic sound 2. Range up to 50 feet 3. Four adjustable ultrasonic volume levels(including a test mode). Test-used to verify the microphone and speaker are functional. Low Range-up to 15 feet/5 meters (Suggest testing indoors). Medium Range-up to 30 feet/10 meters. High Range-up to 50 feet/15 meters 4. Dural and weatherproof for outdoor use 5. LED light flashes for low battery indication 6. 9V Battery operation - (battery not included) 7. Dimension: 6.1×5.5×6.1in, N.W. 0.6Lb, G.W. 1Lb [ Package Includes ] New Outdoor Bark Control (battery not included) and manual [ Caution ] Keep at one-arm-length away from the human ear(s) to avoid hearing damage if a dog begins barking while you are setting up, mounting or hanging the New Outdoor Bark Control. [ Note ] If the dog is deaf or hearing impaired, he may not react to the Outdoor Bark Control","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QgzkQeKeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PET CAREE","source_asin":"B01HMH391A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939666","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HMH391A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HMH391A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
