window.products.push({"id":939952,"name":"Oxo Softworks 9.5 in Turntable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41BkW4TgdwL._AC_.jpg","description":"Find all your necessary pantryware items with a quick spin of the OXO Good Grips 9\" Turntable. The Turntable provides easy access to hard-to-reach items like spices, sauces, cleaning products or tabletop accessories. It can be used on countertops, tabletops and in cabinets. With non-slip feet and a deep ledge, the Turntable keeps your items upright and in place. An innovative wide base design prevents the Turntable from interfering with nearby items or walls as the top tray spins freely. This smooth spinning Turntable features long lasting, durable steel ball bearings. - Soft, non-slip lip for easy turning - Larger base prevents interference with surrounding items and walls - Deep ledge on platform helps keep items upright - Non-slip rubber feet protect all surfaces - Durable steel ball bearings","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41BkW4TgdwL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OXO","source_asin":"B005HZYARM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939952","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005HZYARM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005HZYARM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":939953,"name":"SuprCool 100-Pack Latest Style Waterproof Vinyl Stickers for Laptop, MacBook, Skateboard, Luggage, Car, Bicycle - Funny Random Sticker Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710rYeJgT-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"HOW TO IRONING THE PATCH: 1. Sticking one sides of the Patch that have the hot melt adhesive on the clothes where you want. 2. Turn over the clothes and ironing the clothes where the Patch, sticked 10-13 seconds when the irons temperature closed to 120-150 temperature (If the clothed is thick, need long time,about 15-25 seconds). Uniform heat the Patch is must. 3. Check the Patch pasted the clothes firmly after 5 minutes when the it changes cool. If not, do it again in this method.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710rYeJgT-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SuprCool","source_asin":"B071WX8BJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071WX8BJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071WX8BJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":939954,"name":"Upgrade Thicker Reusable Air Fryer Liners, 8'' Round Silicone Air Fryer Liners, Non-Stick Air Fryer Accessories for Gourmia NINJA Nuwave Chefman and M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RehiuTUBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Reusable & Save Money】- Reusable Air Fryer Liners are perfect replacement for parchment paper, say goodbye to endless papers! You can save money on parchment paper or spare baskets. And our silicone air fryer mats are safe and non-sticky, it is specially designed for air fryer. Buy with confidence！ ✅【Universal fit for large air fryer】- The 8 inches Round air fryer liners fit into most 5.7 QT and larger round baskets as well as air fryer accessories such as an air fryer pot, air fryer pan, or an air fryer tray. It will be a good kitchen helper. Use the reusable air fryer liners for holiday gift, surprise for beloved family members, for lovers, colleague or friends. ✅【Food Safe & Heat Resistant】- The air fryer silicone mats is made of 100% food-grade silicone and Upgraded To Be Thicker, which has better flexibility and tear resistance than other products. Heat resistant temperature is up to 446℉. Avoid parchment paper scraps or potentially toxic materials (such as PFOA, PFAS or heavy metals) coming off the degradable basket coating. Safe for air frying, steaming and baking. ✅【Optimal Airflow Design】- These air fryer silicone liners designed for best air flow to ensure optimal air flow around food items for even heat distribution. No effect on the taste of the food. Perfect for steaming dumpling, turkey, buns and more, satisfy almost all your steaming needs. Make you enjoy healthy and delicious food. ✅【Easy to clean & Multi-purpose】- These greaseproof air fryer accessory, keep your foods integrity and nice look, and easy to clean, just wash it by hand or put it in the dishwasher for added convenience. The flexible material is also perfect to use as trivets or heat dissipating pad for setting hot pan or dish for cooling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RehiuTUBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shadowgallery","source_asin":"B08ZMJS195","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-939954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZMJS195","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZMJS195","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
